From 8d40e96e93e1375254be46232cb2a98f802edfbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert Eriksson <robert.eriksson@relyits.se>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:36:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): list the user's machines first on the Setup page

The Machine page's "Library" list now reads the Machines pane's
catalogue. It shows the machines in the user machines folder first,
then a separator, then the shipped machines. A user machine shows its
name and file name. A refused file shows its first refusal and cannot
be selected. A file selection queues the undoable UseCatalogueMachine.
"Load other" opens in the user machines folder when it exists.

The test shell sets no user machines folder, so no UI test reads the
tester's real folder.

Fixes #2358

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
